      "widgets_values": [
        "## Reference Library example\n\nThis workflow needs two files, both in the pack's `example_workflows/assets` folder:\n\n1. **The demo library.** In the Reference Prompt open **Libraries → Import library…** and pick `Demo.zip`. The tags `@Karl` and `@Alex` turn blue.\n2. **The donut.** Load `Donut.png` in the *Donut goes here* node.\n\nFiles: https://github.com/PixelMonkey77/comfyui-reference-library/tree/main/example_workflows/assets\n"
      ],
